  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "Excuse me. Do you know if this café here has\nclosed for good?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƷ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 484,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0045007800630075007300650020006D0065002E00200044006F00200079006F00750020006B006E006F007700200069006600200074006800690073002000630061006600E9002000680065007200650020006800610073000A0063006C006F00730065006400200066006F007200200067006F006F0064003F00100002011401B70000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 66
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I’m pretty sure it has",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 616,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00492019006D00200070007200650074007400790020007300750072006500200069007400200068006100730000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Yeah, there was a whole thing",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 664,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0059006500610068002C002000740068006500720065002000770061007300200061002000770068006F006C00650020007400680069006E00670000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Is that right? What a shame...<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nIt’s my first time back in Lumiose in 10 years, and\nI’d been hoping to have their coffee once more.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƷ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 724,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 138
    },
    {
      "displayText": "You wouldn’t happen to know where I could find\nthe former owner or anything, would you?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƷ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 1000,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 92
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Well, actually...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 1184,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00570065006C006C002C002000610063007400750061006C006C0079002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I may know someone...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1220,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00490020006D006100790020006B006E006F007700200073006F006D0065006F006E0065002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oh, I’d be grateful to you if you could help me get\nin touch with them!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƷ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1264,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 76
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Who should you ask for more information?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1416,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00570068006F002000730068006F0075006C006400200079006F0075002000610073006B00200066006F00720020006D006F0072006500200069006E0066006F0072006D006100740069006F006E003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Grisham",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1500,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004700720069007300680061006D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Griselle",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1516,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00470072006900730065006C006C00650000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "What could you possibly be calling me for?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0017>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1536,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005700680061007400200063006F0075006C006400200079006F007500200070006F0073007300690062006C0079002000620065002000630061006C006C0069006E00670020006D006500200066006F0072003F00100002011400170000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 47
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oh, I see. In that case, I suggest you go speak\nwith the head barista at our third truck.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0017>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1632,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 94
    },
    {
      "displayText": "She used to work under the master barista who\nserved at Lysandre Café.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0017>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1820,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 75
    },
    {
      "displayText": "What? You want delivery or something?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0018>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1972,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0057006800610074003F00200059006F0075002000770061006E0074002000640065006C006900760065007200790020006F007200200073006F006D0065007400680069006E0067003F00100002011400180000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "You want my help finding some old fart?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0018>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 2056,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0059006F0075002000770061006E00740020006D0079002000680065006C0070002000660069006E00640069006E006700200073006F006D00650020006F006C006400200066006100720074003F00100002011400180000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 44
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Someone who used to make the coffee at\nLysandre Café...<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nI guess I’d say go talk to the head barista at our\nthird truck.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0018>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2144,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 127
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I’m pretty sure she used to work under Lysandre\nCafé’s old barista.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0018>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2400,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00492019006D00200070007200650074007400790020007300750072006500200073006800650020007500730065006400200074006F00200077006F0072006B00200075006E0064006500720020004C007900730061006E006400720065000A00430061006600E9201900730020006F006C006400200062006100720069007300740061002E00100002011400180000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 72
    },
    {
      "displayText": "So if I go to their third truck, I might be able to\nfind out more about this café’s old barista?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƷ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2544,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 101
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I’ve been by it before. Nouveau Café’s Truck No. 3,\nright? It’s in...the <U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>Magenta District<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>, isn’t it?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƷ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 2748,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 113
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I’ll head there at once! I do hope you’ll join me in\nthis little quest—you’ve been such a help so far!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƷ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 2976,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 107
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 3192,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>봆<U+0000><U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>! There you are!\nI’m<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nso<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nglad<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nyou<U+0010><U+0001>븀\ncame!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƷ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 16,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 3204,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BD0600000010000201000000002100200054006800650072006500200079006F007500200061007200650021000A00492019006D00100001BE00000A0073006F00100001BE00000A0067006C0061006400100001BE00000A0079006F007500100001BE00000A00630061006D0065002100100002011401B70000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 63
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Let’s see if we can find out anything more about\nthe former barista of Lysandre Café.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƷ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 3332,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 90
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Can I take your order...or are you not here for a\ncoffee? You look like you’ve got other business.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 3512,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 103
    },
    {
      "displayText": "...I see. And you ended up all the way here, huh?<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nIt’s true that the old barista at Lysandre Café is\nthe one who taught me all I know.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 3720,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 142
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I bet he’ll be pleased as punch to hear that a\nformer customer remembers his coffee so fondly.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 4004,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 99
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I’ll get ahold of him and ask him to go meet you,\nif you’d like to wait outside Lysandre Café.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 4204,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 99
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Amazing! Then I’ll wait for you both there!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƷ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 4404,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0041006D0061007A0069006E006700210020005400680065006E002000492019006C006C0020007700610069007400200066006F007200200079006F007500200062006F00740068002000740068006500720065002100100002011401B70000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 48
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I’ll get ahold of my old teacher and ask him to go\nmeet you at Lysandre Café.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 4500,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 82
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+001E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 4664,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF001E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Wow, I’m actually a bit nervous about meeting\nthe old barista again, now that we’re here.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƷ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 4676,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 94
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Hey, thanks for waiting for us!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 4864,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004800650079002C0020007400680061006E006B007300200066006F0072002000770061006900740069006E006700200066006F0072002000750073002100100002011401B90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "This is the former barista of this café and the man\nwho taught me everything I know—Maît.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 4936,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 94
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Lovely to meet you. I’m humbled to hear that you\nremembered the taste of my coffee and wanted<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nanother cup, even after 10 years.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƸ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 5124,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 135
    },
    {
      "displayText": "There’s only one thing preventing me from being\nable to serve you.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nI always roasted my beans using Pokémon moves,\nbut I’m rather out of practice.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƸ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 5396,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 153
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I wonder if I could ask your Trainer friend here for\na battle so I can hone my rusty skills?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƸ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 5704,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 97
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I want to battle h<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿȂimer too, Maît!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 5900,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0049002000770061006E007400200074006F00200062006100740074006C00650020006800100003110000FF02020069006D0065007200200074006F006F002C0020004D006100EE0074002100100002011401B90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿&",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 5988,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ahhh, yes. Getting to pit my Pokémon’s moves\nagainst the hero who saved our city was just the<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nthing to bring back those old instincts!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƸ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 6000,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 142
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Please, step inside the café with me. I’ll start\npreparing your coffee at once.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƸ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 40,
      "offsetInSection": 6284,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 84
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿)",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 41,
      "offsetInSection": 6452,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00290000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "It’s a bit of a mess right now, but it’s not in that\nbad of shape. I bet with a good cleaning, this<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nplace could be back in business in no time.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 42,
      "offsetInSection": 6464,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 151
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Indeed... And I shall prepare for our guest a cup\nof my personal blend, just as I made it back then.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƸ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 43,
      "offsetInSection": 6768,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 105
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Please have a seat while you wait.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƸ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 44,
      "offsetInSection": 6980,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0050006C00650061007300650020006800610076006500200061002000730065006100740020007700680069006C006500200079006F007500200077006100690074002E00100002011401B80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Yes... Yes, this is exactly it. This is the coffee that\nI remember.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƷ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 45,
      "offsetInSection": 7060,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005900650073002E002E002E0020005900650073002C00200074006800690073002000690073002000650078006100630074006C0079002000690074002E00200054006800690073002000690073002000740068006500200063006F006600660065006500200074006800610074000A0049002000720065006D0065006D006200650072002E00100002011401B70000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 72
    },
    {
      "displayText": "This rich, bitter aroma that tickles the nose...\nThe deep black shine... The hint of sweetness...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƷ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 46,
      "offsetInSection": 7204,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 102
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Maît! You absolute master! It’s just as I remember\nfrom 10 years ago... No, it’s even better!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƷ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 47,
      "offsetInSection": 7408,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 98
    },
    {
      "displayText": "You’re too kind.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƸ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 48,
      "offsetInSection": 7604,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0059006F007520190072006500200074006F006F0020006B0069006E0064002E00100002011401B80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "But I’m afraid I owe you an apology.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƸ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 49,
      "offsetInSection": 7648,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004200750074002000492019006D0020006100660072006100690064002000490020006F0077006500200079006F007500200061006E002000610070006F006C006F00670079002E00100002011401B80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Whatever for?! You’ve prepared me the coffee of a\nlifetime!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƷ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 50,
      "offsetInSection": 7732,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0057006800610074006500760065007200200066006F0072003F002100200059006F00752019007600650020007000720065007000610072006500640020006D0065002000740068006500200063006F00660066006500650020006F006600200061000A006C00690066006500740069006D0065002100100002011401B70000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 64
    },
    {
      "displayText": "That cup you just drank was prepared by me.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 51,
      "offsetInSection": 7860,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0054006800610074002000630075007000200079006F00750020006A0075007300740020006400720061006E006B00200077006100730020007000720065007000610072006500640020006200790020006D0065002E00100002011401B90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 48
    },
    {
      "displayText": "What?!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƷ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 52,
      "offsetInSection": 7956,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0057006800610074003F002100100002011401B70000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I was once a barista—it’s true. But I retired from\nthat life after the whole Team Flare debacle.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƸ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 53,
      "offsetInSection": 7980,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 101
    },
    {
      "displayText": "But Trois here didn’t want the taste of my coffee\nto be forgotten.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƸ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 54,
      "offsetInSection": 8184,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004200750074002000540072006F00690073002000680065007200650020006400690064006E20190074002000770061006E007400200074006800650020007400610073007400650020006F00660020006D007900200063006F0066006600650065000A0074006F00200062006500200066006F00720067006F007400740065006E002E00100002011401B80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 71
    },
    {
      "displayText": "This city is always changing, but there are some\nthings that simply make Lumiose...well, Lumiose.<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nMaît’s coffee was one of those things.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 55,
      "offsetInSection": 8328,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 144
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I suppose all of us, people and Pokémon, want to\nleave our mark on the city so that we might be<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nremembered after we’re gone.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƸ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 56,
      "offsetInSection": 8616,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 132
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Yes... Well, I am certainly very glad that I’ll still\nbe able to partake of this coffee I love so much.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƷ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 57,
      "offsetInSection": 8880,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 108
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I don’t know when I’ll next be in Lumiose, but I’ll\nfind you to beg for another taste, Trois.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƷ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 58,
      "offsetInSection": 9096,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 98
    },
    {
      "displayText": "And I’ll be waiting for your visit, dear customer.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 59,
      "offsetInSection": 9292,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0041006E0064002000492019006C006C002000620065002000770061006900740069006E006700200066006F007200200079006F00750072002000760069007300690074002C0020006400650061007200200063007500730074006F006D00650072002E00100002011401B90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 55
    }
